.TH ORANGED 8 2026-10-18 orange "System Manager's Manual"
.SH NAME
oranged \- the Orange XMPP server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B oranged
.RI [ option ]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B oranged
is the XMPP server of the Orange project.
It is not implemented yet: started without options, it reports that and
exits.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-help
Display a usage message and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Output version information and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 for
.B \-\-help
and
.BR \-\-version ,
1 otherwise, 2 for a usage error.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR orange-agent (1),
.BR orange-cli (1)
.PP
The full documentation is the Texinfo manual:
.B info orange
